# Build context is the repo root for `docker build -f docker/Dockerfile .`.
# Keep the context lean and the image deterministic — no developer artifacts.

# Build outputs (re-created in the Docker stages)
**/bin
**/obj
**/artifacts
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Admin UI is built in its own stage — never bake a locally built copy
src/Cocoar.Shelf/wwwroot/
**/dist/

# Node / pnpm
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store/

# VitePress (public docs are deployed separately, not part of the image)
website/
**/.vitepress/cache/
**/.vitepress/dist/

# Test artifacts
**/TestResults/
**/coverage*

# Local dev environment
dev/
**/.local
**/local

# Git + editor noise
**/.git
.github
**/*.md
LICENSE
.editorconfig
.gitignore
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.dev.yml
